{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:12 2026-11-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:12 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:12 2026-11-14 HKT</p><img alt=\"第六場賽事取消\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/aff0b298fc1ee57a4a80b65b2bb6c5c6/2026-11/f7429ae9-2b51-4425-bca6-94b0cbf3f64d.jpg\"/><p>鑑於沙田馬場全天候跑道的狀況受昨夜大量降雨影響，香港賽馬會經諮詢騎師後，決定取消今日（11月14日）第六場賽事「Panasonic Nanoe護髮風筒讓賽」（第四班，1650米）。</p><p>馬會將進一步評估跑道全天候跑道的狀況，然後決定第十場賽事「Technics 耳機讓賽」（第三班，1650米）會否按原定安排舉行。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5d693e6d93279f87118385015a6a9aee/2026-11/38c78982-678f-487b-93e7-c470b402346c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4b10440053772bf664787067c43ea870/2026-11/401ff41d-51d3-4c00-947a-eb471ff3d152.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/84a40568fee73edd62664c15bb41a865/2026-11/e386d2a4-9776-42bc-92fc-79bea30b0b6b.jpg\"/><p></p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d27a31f08ba310d7d002ce05750211f1/2026-11/3fe50253-a85a-435a-b3be-882f97af2399.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/32d61f103a7735f4ef4d1e37cd5d91e8/2026-11/8b79ca87-5e38-4a51-9643-cfa265d4e189.jpg\"/><img alt=\"第六場賽事已不再受注。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b2a534afd8ddd948ebefce57452e7636/2026-11/179464034697533.jpeg\" title=\"第六場賽事已不再受注。\"/><p>第六場賽事已不再受注。</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:41:44.965327+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:12:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:35:08.324478+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:35:08.324478+00:00","content_hash":"8dac9c2a14dcbb8598dc3bb5ae05fc076534432114c253d412ebfeb58e530c5d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}